1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,300
It was 2007, and I was Amanda Diva.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,300
I had just come home from the Floetry remix tour

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:09,260
and decided to take a shot at doing my own album.

4
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:14,520
And I took a poem that I had done on Deaf Poetry Jam.

5
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:18,240
Please give me one Deaf Poetry welcome to Miss Amanda Diva.

6
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:21,500
Y'all good?

7
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:22,980
Good.

8
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:23,720
All right.

9
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:26,880
I got 40 MCs on my block,

10
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:29,660
walking with a bop, claiming that they real hip-hop.

11
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:33,500
And turned it into this, 40 MCs featuring Q-Tip.

12
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:37,260
Off my first music album, Life Experience.

13
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:40,440
Available at amandadivamusic.com.

14
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,000
This is K Slay the Drama King,

15
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:45,220
chilling with Amanda Diva, 40 MCs.

16
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:46,300
You already know what it is.

17
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,060
I love this guy.

18
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:56,370
The heart of these dudes,

19
00:00:56,650 --> 00:00:58,570
coming up to me, oh, I can be.

20
