Suck in bed, I got beats.

21
00:01:00,590 --> 00:01:02,110
I can spit a hot 16.

22
00:01:02,110 --> 00:01:10,060
I'm talking with a bop, claiming that they real hip-hop.

23
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:13,080
80 feet in Timbs and sagging jeans.

24
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:15,980
Rhyming about cream, chasing the same dream.

25
00:01:16,140 --> 00:01:17,820
This rhyme is a little dig.

26
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:21,940
About the 40 MCs on what seems like every block in New York City.

27
00:01:22,100 --> 00:01:23,480
It's a pity most ain't rhyming.

28
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:25,020
For the love, it's for the fame.

29
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:27,280
Treating this culture like it's a game.

30
00:01:27,820 --> 00:01:30,900
The mental state is getting minds when they script between the lines.

31
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:32,360
They ain't worried about the rhyme.

32
00:01:44,970 --> 00:02:00,320
One got shot, one got tough.

33
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:03,260
It didn't take much for the MCs to get hooked.

34
00:02:03,420 --> 00:02:04,760
Cause everybody wants to be.

35
00:02:04,760 --> 00:04:17,410
Now it's 2026 and I'm reclaiming my timeline.

36
